paperweight-plymouth (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=low

  * Initial packaging. Catppuccin Macchiato Plymouth boot splash using the
    script plugin. Solid base background with pulsing centered label.
    Sets default Plymouth theme and rebuilds initramfs on install/remove.
  * debian/control: add plymouth-label to Depends — required for
    Image.Text() in the script plugin; without it the label silently fails.
  * paperweight.script: move logo SetX/SetY into refresh_callback so
    centering runs after the framebuffer is live, not at script load time.
    Remove no-op global angle declaration.

 -- Alex Long <johnalexanderlong@gmail.com>  Mon, 09 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
